  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be retained in accordance with the following approved plans:\rP101 REV C01\rP 102 REV C01\rP 103 REV C01\rP 104 REV C01\rLocation Plan\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "Within 3 months of this permission, details of refuse storage facilities including facilities for the recycling of waste shall be provided within the development in pursuance of the HMO hereby approved and in accordance with the London Borough of Enfield Waste and Recycling Planning Storage Guidance ENV 08/162. This shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority prior to occupation of the development. The facilities shall be provided in accordance with the approved details and maintained as such thereafter.\r \rReason: In the interests of amenity and the recycling of waste materials in support of the Boroughs waste reduction targets\r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 5 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units. The proposed living area in the outbuilding shall only be used as a living area in connection with the HMO and shall not be used as a separate unit.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r"
  ],
